  "hints": [
    "A Sieve of Eratosthenes marks multiples of each prime p starting from p * p as False inside a boolean bytearray/list of size n + 1.",
    "You only need to cross off multiples up to p <= int(n ** 0.5). Return all indices i >= 2 still True.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  is_prime = [True] * (n + 1)\n  is_prime[0] = is_prime[1] = False\n  for p in range(2, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n      if is_prime[p]: mark p*p..n step p as False"
  ],
